# MCP Server Rules

The MCP server exposes snippet data to AI coding tools.

---

# Server Stack

Use:

```

Node.js
TypeScript
Express

```

---

# Server Responsibilities

The server must:

```

serve snippet metadata
serve snippet HTML
support AI tooling

```

---

# API Endpoints

List snippets:

```

GET /snippets

```

Get snippet:

```

GET /snippets/:id

```

---

# Response Format

Always return JSON.

Example:

```

{
id,
title,
html,
jsx,
thumbnail,
sourceUrl
}

```

---

# AI Tool Integration

Expose tools:

```

list_snippets
get_snippet

```

These tools allow AI editors to fetch UI components.

---

# Security

Do not expose:

```

private browsing data
sensitive content

```

---

# Future MCP Features

Potential additions:

```

search_snippets
similar_ui_search

```
